  const date = parseTimeValue(value)
  return date ? formatDate(date, { includeYear: true }) : value
}
```

But note `bridgeElement.bridgeAttribute("description")` returns attribute value with `data-bridge-description`; fine.

Also, the MutationObserver re-sends on attribute changes. Fine.

